-$(PACKAGE_NAME)/Device/$(TARGET_DEVICE)/PatchedBinaries/QcomWDogDxe.inf
+# 2026-11-07R50 y700-elden: 与 DXE.inc/APRIORI.inc 同步摘掉（[Components] 里不再编它）
